(text "IO-Link station: eight-bit input carrier - revision A" (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1afcd12a-b7a7-5a87-bfed-6b91ff557ac8"))
(text "SN74HC165N at 3V3. J1: 1/6 GND, 2 +3V3, 3 CLK, 4 /LOAD, 5 DATA (QH).\nNUCLEO-L476RG: PB13=CLK (CN10.30), PC6=/LOAD (CN10.4), PB14=DATA (CN10.28).\nPower from Nucleo 3V3 only. This board connects logic inputs, not the 24V IO-Link field cable." (at 20.32 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cc46a1c8-f5bb-508d-8793-f8f3a36fe3d8"))
(text "J2 odd pins 1..15 = A..H; every even pin is GND.\nFit Samtec SNT-100-BK-G shunt for zero; remove for one.\nQH delivers H first: firmware PD bit7=H, bit0=A." (at 165.1 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "073a6f88-2900-574a-abbb-52675644ce68"))
(text "50 x 40 x 1.6 mm PCB; two layers; mounting pattern 42 x 32 mm.\nU1 pin 7 (/QH) is intentionally unconnected. SER and CLK INH are grounded.\nBuild two identical input boards for the two physical IO-Link devices." (at 20.32 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3066dc3d-c76c-55cc-b071-6340a5710030"))
(embedded_fonts no)
)
